      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to feel like an intruder when you walked away, and that guilt over \"taking the easy way out\" will likely weigh on you for a long time. I want you to know that seeking help or support for others was a profound act of love, no matter how painful the decision felt to you. Please remember that you are not as bad as you feel right now, and you don't deserve the self-condemnation you are giving yourself with every thought you have.",
